class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: <a href=\"#/wiki/Creatures\">Creatures</a></nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-item-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20220810184725&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Primal_Pack_Beast_Emerald_Tortoise_f72775.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"creature-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see a primal pack beast.</div></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiaorange\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>It spawns with the shape of a spider egg <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Primal Pack Beast\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Primal_Pack_Beast_f0e2f0.gif\" width=\"32\"/></span> and changes into the shape of a <a href=\"#/wiki/Emerald%20Tortoise\">Emerald Tortoise</a> one second later. If it's not killed in 20 seconds it becomes a <a href=\"#/wiki/Fungosaurus\">Fungosaurus</a> with full health. It's one of the 11 different types of Primal Pack Beasts.\n</p><p>It's part of the fight against <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Primal%20Menace\">The Primal Menace</a> during the Primal Ordeal Quest.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-abilities\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Abilities\">Abilities</span></h3>\n<div class=\"ability_list\"><div class=\"creatureAbility\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"Critical Hit Effect (Static)\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"19\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Critical_Hit_Effect_Static_dbdf2b.gif\" width=\"24\"/></span> Can deal Critical Hits</span></div></div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"